1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Sam Okafor: Morning all. Quick weekly ops, three things: the Hillcrest start, the bulbs and the till.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Rosa Delgado: Hillcrest signed. They pushed back on price so we agreed $2,250 a month, not the $2,400 we quoted.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Rosa Delgado: First visit is Monday 5 October at Maple Court.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Priya Nair: I have set Hillcrest up in the books: invoiced on the first of the month, payment due in 30 days.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Jo Fairweather: The crew can do Maple Court and Birch Row on Mondays and the other four sites on Thursdays.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Sam Okafor: Autumn bulbs arrive next Tuesday. I need two people to set up the bulb display on Wednesday.

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Jo Fairweather: I can lend one person from the crew on Wednesday morning.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Priya Nair: One from me: the card machine has been double-charging refunds. I have logged it with the provider.

9
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Rosa Delgado: Priya, please chase them by Friday, and until it is fixed we do refunds as store credit.

10
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Sam Okafor: Decided then. I will put a sign up at the tills today.
